# Frontend Development Patterns

Vue 3 Options API patterns for building performant, maintainable user interfaces.

**Note**: For Inertia.js integration patterns, see `inertia-patterns.mdc`.

## Component Patterns (Vue 3 Options API)

### Composition Over Inheritance

```vue
<!-- Card.vue -->
